---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Videos
permalink: /videos/
description: Visual essays, grove walks and whiteboard cosmology from EGregoRA.
---

<section class="page-head">
  <p class="kicker">The Moving Image</p>
  <h1>Videos</h1>
  <p class="lede muted">Visual essays, grove walks, star charts and whiteboard cosmology.</p>
</section>

{% set dsKind = "video" %}
{% include "partials/device-studio.njk" %}

<div class="divider">✦</div>

{% set amKind = "video" %}{% set amNoun = "a film" %}{% set amIt = "it" %}
{% include "partials/admin-media.njk" %}

<div class="divider">✦</div>

<section class="wrap">
  <div class="grid two" id="uploaded-media" data-kind="video" hidden></div>
  <div class="grid two">
    {% for v in videos %}
    <article class="frame card reveal">
      <div class="embed">
        {% if v.embed %}
          <iframe src="{{ v.embed }}" title="{{ v.title }}" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture"></iframe>
        {% else %}
          <div class="placeholder">
            <div class="glyph">{% glyph "eye" %}</div>
            <p class="meta meta--caps">Film pending upload</p>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <p class="tag mt-1">{{ v.date }} · {{ v.length }}</p>
      <h3>{{ v.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ v.summary }}</p>
      <p class="muted xsmall">{{ v.tags | join(" · ") }}</p>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <div class="upload-note">
      <strong>For Ed — how to publish a new video.</strong>
      Add an entry to <code>src/_data/videos.json</code> with an <code>embed</code> URL:
      <pre class="code-block">{ "title": "…", "date": "2026-10-20", "length": "18m", "summary": "…",
  "embed": "https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/VIDEO_ID", "tags": ["astronomy"] }</pre>
      YouTube, Vimeo (<code>https://player.vimeo.com/video/ID</code>) and PeerTube embeds all work. Leave
      <code>embed</code> empty and the ornate placeholder holds the slot until the film is ready.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="module" src="/assets/js/freeai-admin.js?v={{ build.id }}"></script>
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/media-admin.js?v={{ build.id }}"></script>
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/device-studio.js?v={{ build.id }}"></script>
